sequenceDiagram
  participant Feature as Web feature
  participant Document as Generated document
  participant Client as GraphQL client
  participant API as PostGraphile
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Feature->>Document: Select typed query or mutation
  Feature->>Client: Execute operation with variables
  Client->>API: Send GraphQL request
  API->>DB: Resolve operation under database role and limits
  DB-->>API: Result data or errors
  API-->>Client: GraphQL response
  Client-->>Feature: Typed result state
